 research steps component within the AI conversation interface when Rovo (the AI assistant) is processing a research request and generating a response. Shown as text in a loading state indicator. The purpose is to inform users that the AI is actively working on their research request and will respond shortly, providing feedback during the wait time."},collapse:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-platform-ui-components.compact-research-steps.collapse",defaultMessage:"Collapse",description:"Button label or action text displayed on a button or clickable element in a compact research steps component within the AI conversation interface that collapses to hide detailed step information. Shown as clickable text on a collapse/expand control. When clicked, it collapses the research steps to show only a summary. The purpose is to allow users to minimize the research steps display to save screen space and reduce visual clutter."},thinkDeeperThinking:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-platform-ui-components.compact-research-steps.think-deeper-thinking",defaultMessage:"Thinking deeply and analyzing",description:"The message displayed for think deeper thinking"},executeBashSubstep:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-platform-ui-components.compact-research-steps.execute-bash-substep",defaultMessage:"Writing and executing code",description:"Substep preview text shown for trace steps emitted by the execute_bash tool, indicating Rovo is writing and executing a bash command on the user's behalf. Replaces the raw command/output snippet to keep the trace readable. Also rendered as the first substep when the trace is expanded."}});n.d(t,{},{A:a})},925517(e,t,n){n.d(t,{J:()=>i});var a=n(745975),r=n(364026),o=n(804852),l=n(11336),c=(0,n(644725).defineMessages)({addedLozenge:{id:"rovo-platform-ui-components.confluence-finalized-lozenge.addedLozenge",defaultMessage:"Added",description:"Lozenge shown once Confluence content has already been finalized into a space."},addedToSpaceTooltip:{id:"rovo-platform-ui-components.confluence-finalized-lozen